1. PLAYING THE GAME
---------------------------------------
To play the game, simply type SKYNET
from the directory you have the game
installed (usually c:\skynet).

MAIN MENU
---------
NEW GAME: Starts a new game.
LOAD: Loads a saved game.
SAVE: Saves a game in progress.
OPTIONS: Allows you to change controls and
	 graphic detail.
QUIT: Returns to DOS.

NEW GAME
--------
MULTI-PLAYER: Starts a multi-player game.
SINGLE PLAYER: Starts a single player game.
TUTORIAL: Not available in the demo.
FUTURE SHOCK: Not available in the demo.
EXIT: Returns to the Main Menu.

MULTI-PLAYER
------------
NEW GAME: Starts a new game that other players
	  can join. The first person in the game
	  selects all of the game parameters.
JOIN GAME: Scans the network for games being played.
	   Once the list of games is shown, click on
	   a game to join it. 
EXIT: Returns to the New Game menu.	

CONTROLS
--------
