Look Up/Down:		Mouse
Fire:			Left Mouse Button
Throw:			Right Mouse Button
Forward:		A
Back:			Z
Slide Right:		X
Slide Left:		Left SHIFT
Run:			ALT
Jump:			S
Crouch:			C
Automap:		TAB
Menu:			ESC
Full Screen:		F6
Decrease Brightness:	F7
Increase Brightness:	F8
